/P 107 0 R
/T (Both recursive functions worked and matched the iterative and formula versions on all tests. The call counts \(31 vs 6 for 2^30\) matched the recurrences, and the linear version overflowed the stack near n = 262,000. I learned that a base case and a small recursion depth are essential.)
