/S /H2
/P 107 0 R
/T (Iterative square-and-multiply: time O\(log n\) like the halving recursion, but stack O\(1\) instead of O\(log n\); the linear recursion is O\(n\) time and O\(n\) stack.)
/E (Iterative square-and-multiply: time O\(log n\) like the halving recursion, but stack O\(1\) instead of O\(log n\); the linear recursion is O\(n\) time and O\(n\) stack.)
/Pg 17 0 R
/K [11]
>>
